@startuml 10_code_map
title 10. Code map: which file does what
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "src/atomic_counter.hpp (shared apparatus)" {
  [Counter concept\nwhat every counter must provide] as Concept
  [Counter types\nPlainCounter, LoadStoreCounter,\nFetchAddCounter, CasCounter,\nSpinlockCounter, MutexCounter] as Types
  [Layouts\nPackedCounters, PaddedCounters] as Layouts
  [race<C>()\npin, barrier, time, verify] as Race
  [measure(), measure_interleaved()\nwarmup, trials, statistics] as Measure
}

[exp1_sanity.cpp] as E1
[exp2_mutex.cpp] as E2
[exp3_atomic.cpp] as E3
[exp4_compare.cpp] as E4
[exp5_thread_scaling.cpp] as E5
[exp6_false_sharing.cpp] as E6

E1 --> Measure
E2 --> Measure
E3 --> Measure
E4 --> Measure
E5 --> Measure
E6 --> Measure
Measure --> Race
Race --> Concept : calls increment()
Types ..> Concept : implements
Layouts --> Types : one per thread

footer exp2 and exp3 differ only in which counter type is constructed. benchmark/run.sh runs each binary 5 times.
@enduml
